  },
  "@id": "chat",
  "@type": "App",
  "position": 34,
  "id": "chat",
  "family": "make",
  "icon": "💬",
  "name": "Chat",
  "surface": "panel",
  "panel": "chat",
  "desc": "Rooms, messages and app activity, over XMPP",
  "capabilities": [
    "shell"
  ],
  "silent": true,
  "notes": [
    "The shell's XMPP connection and its MUC room (FoafChat, packages/foafos/src/chat.mjs). By default the Factoidal Lean XMPP server runs in the page; it can point at factoidal xmpp-serve on localhost instead, so an ordinary XMPP client can join and watch. Shell chrome for the Pods tab's reason: a server password typed here goes straight into FoafSecrets. Design: docs/foafos-chat-20261103.md."
  ]
}
